course: dictionary
lesson: 6004
title: One word, several meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning, and the words around them tell you which meaning to use. Mechanic can mean a person, a rule in a game, or the science of forces. Look at the context first.
explain: «Good game design starts with what is special: a new mechanic, story or feeling.» Here a mechanic is a rule or way a game works, because the sentence is about game design. A game mechanic is how the game plays, such as jumping or collecting coins.
explain: «Mechanics lift cars on ramps, plug in computers to read faults and replace worn parts.» Here mechanics means people, the workers who repair cars. Mechanics with an s can also mean the science of how forces make things move.
fact: A mechanic is a person whose job is to repair and look after engines and machines, especially cars.
fact: In a game, a mechanic is a rule or way something works, such as «a jumping mechanic».
fact: Mechanics, in science, is about the forces that make things move.
fact: Useful phrases are car mechanic, bike mechanic, and take it to the mechanic.
fact: To check your meaning, swap it into the sentence. If «a new rule» fits, the game meaning is right.
exercise: «Mechanics lift cars on ramps, plug in computers to read faults and replace worn parts.» In this sentence, who are the mechanics? | Rules that a game uses | *People who repair cars and machines | Metal ramps for parking | Scientists who study the Moon
exercise: «Good game design starts with what is special: a new mechanic, story or feeling.» In this sentence, what does mechanic mean? | A person who repairs bikes | The science of forces | *A rule or way a game works | A kind of car engine
exercise: Dad says, «Take the bike to the mechanic.» What does mechanic mean here? | A way of counting | A type of bridge | *A person who repairs bikes | A rule in a game
test: Ella asks, «What do game mechanics mean?» Which answer is best? | A game with a prize at the end | *The rules or ways a game works | A person who fixes games | The science of ice
test: Leo reads, «Mechanics help explain how a bike moves when you push the pedals.» Which meaning fits best? | A person who sells bikes | A shop that rents bikes | A rule in a game | *The science of how forces make things move
exam: Which sentence uses mechanic to mean a person? | «Mechanics help explain how a bike moves.» | «A jumping mechanic makes the hero fly higher.» | «Good game design starts with what is special: a new mechanic, story or feeling.» | *«Nobody goes under a raised car except the mechanic doing the job safely.»
